# Bug 2: Taught phrase inside a hyphenated capability label gets expanded in parser.py:314
# Because '-' has t.kind == 'sym', expand_sentence() expands "vip" before ':'!

Players is a collection.
Each player has a name (text) and a score (number).

"vip" means score at least 100.

add-player: add a player.
# Intended command name: "show-vip"
# Actual compiled command name: "show-score-at-least-100"!
show-vip: show the name of players vip.
